ktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0\n\nMain branch (you will usually use this for PRs): main\n\nGit user: Mykyta Svyrydenko\n\nStatus:\n(clean)\n\nRecent commits:\nad84c25 rules: a doc re-freeze or an edited declaration touches only the capabilities whose judges read it\n809d9c0 codex, cursor: task-notifications (codex unsupported, cursor supported), recorded in runs/task-notifications-* (#105)\nc3be394 codex, cursor: agent-input-validation cells supported, recorded with the real harnesses (#104)\n3cc192a codex, cursor: session-resume-unknown cells (codex supported with deviations, cursor unsupported) (#103)\n0d726d5 codex: background-bash-reaped-at-exit supported; cursor unsupported (recorded) (#102)\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a63bb90a3bc6561be","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0"}
