{"parentUuid":"14ae1ff5-0424-4cba-9d76-5f45912775c9","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"a63bb90a3bc6561be","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XTA33SF2KXcbU6wDnHJm9j","type":"tool_result","content":"statement: >-\n  A hook fires each time the agent finishes responding. Its payload carries\n  the agent's last message, whether the agent is already continuing because an\n  earlier hook blocked, and the background tasks still running. (What those\n  tasks, and the scheduled wakeups the payload also lists, look like belongs\n  to their own capabilities.)\nproviders:\n  claude:\n    docs:\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks#stop\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks#stop-input\n    runs:\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/stops\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/bgbash\n  codex:\n    docs:\n      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#stop\n    runs:\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/stops\n<<<<<<< HEAD\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/bg-bash-reaped-at-exit\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/stop-no-message\n    deviations:\n      - adr: capability-grounding\n        statement: >-\n          Codex's Stop payload lists no background tasks: the recorded Stop of\n          a turn that ended while a command was still running carries the same\n          fields (session, turn, transcript, cwd, model, permission mode,\n          stop_hook_active, last_assistant_message) as one with none running,\n          and the hooks doc lists no such field.\n=======\n      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/user-prompt-submit-hook-bg\n    deviations:\n      - adr: capability-grounding\n        statement: >-\n          Codex's Stop payload does not list background tasks still running:\n          it carries the last assistant message and the continuation flag\n          beside the common fields, and no field names a background task, in\n          its doc or in any recorded payload, the Stop of a turn that started a\n          background command included (runs/stops,\n          runs/user-prompt-submit-hook-bg). The mock sends the same fields.\n>>>>>>> b475bd3c (codex: tests/recordings for session-end-hook, user-prompt-submit-hook, stop-hook-payload, hook-exit-code-semantics)\n  cursor:\n    supported: false\n    reason: cursor-agent in print mode never fires the stop hook (the run configured one logging its payload), so no payload with a last message, continuation flag or background tasks is ever delivered.\n    runs:\n      - cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/stop-hook-payload","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d9a30e5d-3d66-4aa6-b466-c20f908b50ae","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:53:48.048Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"14ae1ff5-0424-4cba-9d76-5f45912775c9","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a63bb90a3bc6561be","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-adc1470310079e23b"}
