{"parentUuid":"08c650a3-453c-4199-a0dd-ec9f9f1df143","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a63bb90a3bc6561be","attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a63bb90a3bc6561be/spec/capabilities/stop-hook-payload.yaml","snippet":"12\t    runs:\n13\t      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/stops\n14\t      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/bgbash\n15\t  codex:\n16\t    docs:\n17\t      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#stop\n18\t    runs:\n19\t      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/stops\n20\t      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/bg-bash-reaped-at-exit\n21\t      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/stop-no-message\n22\t      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/user-prompt-submit-hook-bg\n23\t    deviations:\n24\t      - adr: capability-grounding\n25\t        statement: >-\n26\t<<<<<<< HEAD\n27\t          Codex's Stop payload lists no background tasks: the recorded Stop of\n28\t          a turn that ended while a command was still running carries the same\n29\t          fields (session, turn, transcript, cwd, model, permission mode,\n30\t          stop_hook_active, last_assistant_message) as one with none running,\n31\t          and the hooks doc lists no such field.\n32\t=======\n33\t          Codex's Stop payload does not list background tasks still running:\n34\t          it carries the last assistant message and the continuation flag\n35\t          beside the common fields, and no field names a background task, in\n36\t          its doc or in any recorded payload, the Stop of a turn that started a\n37\t          background command included (runs/stops,\n38\t          runs/user-prompt-submit-hook-bg). The mock sends the same fields.\n39\t      - adr: modeled-surface\n40\t        statement: >-\n41\t          The docs give a Stop payload's last assistant message as a string or\n42\t          null (\"if available\"); no recording shows a Stop with none, and the\n43\t          mock's payload always carries the string of what the agent said last\n44\t          (empty when it said nothing), so the null form is not modeled.\n45\t>>>>>>> 2543d943 (codex: a Stop carries the agent's latest message; declare the unmodeled null form)\n46\t  cursor:\n47\t    supported: false\n48\t    reason: cursor-agent in print mode never fires the stop hook (the run configured one logging its payload), so no payload with a last message, continuation flag or background tasks is ever delivered.\n49\t    runs:\n50\t      - cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/stop-hook-payload"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ae4e5046-c62c-474e-afa3-85570858c641","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:53:52.843Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: /Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a63bb90a3bc6561be/spec/capabilities/stop-hook-payload.yaml changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n12\t    runs:\n13\t      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/stops\n14\t      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/bgbash\n15\t  codex:\n16\t    docs:\n17\t      - https://developers.openai.com/codex/hooks#stop\n18\t    runs:\n19\t      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/stops\n20\t      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/bg-bash-reaped-at-exit\n21\t      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/stop-no-message\n22\t      - codex-mock/snapshots/runs/user-prompt-submit-hook-bg\n23\t    deviations:\n24\t      - adr: capability-grounding\n25\t        statement: >-\n26\t<<<<<<< HEAD\n27\t          Codex's Stop payload lists no background tasks: the recorded Stop of\n28\t          a turn that ended while a command was still running carries the same\n29\t          fields (session, turn, transcript, cwd, model, permission mode,\n30\t          stop_hook_active, last_assistant_message) as one with none running,\n31\t          and the hooks doc lists no such field.\n32\t=======\n33\t          Codex's Stop payload does not list background tasks still running:\n34\t          it carries the last assistant message and the continuation flag\n35\t          beside the common fields, and no field names a background task, in\n36\t          its doc or in any recorded payload, the Stop of a turn that started a\n37\t          background command included (runs/stops,\n38\t          runs/user-prompt-submit-hook-bg). The mock sends the same fields.\n39\t      - adr: modeled-surface\n40\t        statement: >-\n41\t          The docs give a Stop payload's last assistant message as a string or\n42\t          null (\"if available\"); no recording shows a Stop with none, and the\n43\t          mock's payload always carries the string of what the agent said last\n44\t          (empty when it said nothing), so the null form is not modeled.\n45\t>>>>>>> 2543d943 (codex: a Stop carries the agent's latest message; declare the unmodeled null form)\n46\t  cursor:\n47\t    supported: false\n48\t    reason: cursor-agent in print mode never fires the stop hook (the run configured one logging its payload), so no payload with a last message, continuation flag or background tasks is ever delivered.\n49\t    runs:\n50\t      - cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/stop-hook-payload\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a63bb90a3bc6561be","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-adc1470310079e23b"}
